    "summary": "Bearer: a **BIG MEK** model.\n\nWhile an **ORKS WALKER** unit of yours, other than a **BIG MEK** unit, is up to 3\" from the bearer:\n\n- the bearer gets [Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)\n- you can pick, in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), an **ORKS WALKER** unit of yours up to 3\" from the bearer; that unit can re-roll 1s to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) for the rest of the turn",
